  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kenya Catalytic Jobs Fund is a &#xa3;5m, 4-year programme that aims to test and support the scale up of innovations that have the potential to stimulate job creation. The programme takes the form of a challenge fund, with calls for proposals to select and support the best innovations, through a mix of grants and tailored technical assistance. It focuses on agriculture, manufacturing, and informal sectors, and seeks to capitalize on the opportunity presented by the youthful Kenyan population to accelerate social and economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
